#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:4 e8a7c3b8f62f4ab48b6084c53b04c520
msgid "混音系统"
msgstr "Mixing System"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:6 7ed4d151796943199b4d5b868980bbbb
msgid ""
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` "
"保存总线和效果器配置，:ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` 创建对应的运行时总线和 DSP。将音乐、音效和对白分别送到 "
"``Music``、``SFX``、``Voice``，即可按类别调整音量和效果。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` stores bus and effect configuration; "
":ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` creates runtime buses and DSPs. Route music, sound effects, "
"and dialogue to ``Music``, ``SFX``, and ``Voice`` to adjust volume and effects by category."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:9 1a83e6e9cd5847dea2b72cb1ae12f37d
msgid "选择布局来源"
msgstr "Choose the layout source"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:11 82362788745149768a6897157e5fd991
msgid "项目设置中的 ``audio/fmod`` 提供两个选项："
