#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:21 8d786da58e4b4188a17fccbb988104b4
msgid "使用 Godot Audio 面板中的总线配置，支持的效果器自动转换为 FMOD 效果"
msgstr "Use the Godot Audio panel configuration and convert supported effects to FMOD effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:22 662948b549a242f6a5ab13088fc5b860
