#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:24 1587b6ed0af74e3fa737e135263306df
msgid "独立模式启动时加载的 FMOD 布局资源"
msgstr "FMOD layout resource loaded at startup in independent mode"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:26 6a18a14080b34637a6e3386fdf3b9ff6
msgid "修改同步开关后重新加载项目。开启同步时，在原生 Audio 面板或通过 `AudioServer`_ 修改配置；FMOD Audio 面板显示同步提示和打开原生面板的入口。"
msgstr ""
"Reload the project after changing synchronization. With synchronization enabled, edit the "
"configuration in the native Audio panel or through `AudioServer`_. The FMOD Audio panel displays "
"a synchronization hint and an entry to open the native panel."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:28 21ff8d862b944a0cbd2fa0e5d791c3ea
msgid ""
"关闭同步后，使用 FMOD Audio 面板编辑独立布局。默认文件不存在时，使用内存中的 ``Master``，首次编辑保存时创建文件。加载失败会报告错误并回退到 "
"``Master``；编辑器会保留错误状态，避免自动覆盖损坏的默认文件。"
msgstr ""
"With synchronization disabled, edit an independent layout in FMOD Audio. A missing default file "
"uses an in-memory ``Master`` and is created on the first authoring save. Loading errors are "
"reported and fall back to ``Master``. The editor keeps the error state to prevent autosave from "
"overwriting a damaged default file."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:30 7997539bf4514e4b96d7499b78f25b28
msgid "下文修改布局的代码示例使用独立模式。运行时修改配置会更新当前声音；写入文件需要调用 ``ResourceSaver.save()``。"
msgstr ""
"The layout-editing examples below use independent mode. Runtime configuration changes affect "
"current audio; writing them to a file requires ``ResourceSaver.save()``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:33 83f4f6a9316f4800b79d3e0e98e749f8
msgid "FMOD Audio 面板"
msgstr "FMOD Audio panel"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:35 5110897b3d204b25a5cba3a0a1931b1b
msgid ""
"面板默认停靠在编辑器底栏，与 Audio 面板并列，可浮动并恢复保存的布局。音量推子、效果器勾选、右键菜单、拖放和撤销重做沿用原生 Audio 面板的操作方式。拖动音量时按住 Ctrl "
"可使用整数分贝步进。"
msgstr ""
"The panel docks beside Audio in the editor bottom bar. It supports floating windows and saved "
"layout restoration. Volume faders, effect checkboxes, context menus, drag and drop, and undo/redo"
" follow the native Audio panel. Hold Ctrl while dragging volume for whole-decibel steps."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:37 38c814a68d8b4402b95f9c56fc25a46f
msgid "顶部操作包括："
msgstr "The toolbar provides:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:39 c11a1cd056af4d28aefeb428df535f24
msgid "**Add Bus**：添加总线"
msgstr "**Add Bus**: Add a bus"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:40 8b079770595d479098baba82719809e1
msgid "**Load**：打开布局，保留项目默认布局设置"
msgstr "**Load**: Open a layout while keeping the project default"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:41 14fd3be66bd94fc8b15139b2079f6916
msgid "**Save As**：另存当前布局"
msgstr "**Save As**: Save the current layout to another file"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:42 e3c58712e94642058638a72569f57c69
msgid "**Load Default**：加载项目默认布局"
msgstr "**Load Default**: Open the project default layout"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:43 181cd4eb65854680a930579cd22858ff
msgid "**Create**：创建并保存新布局"
msgstr "**Create**: Create and save a new layout"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:44 4124a1de32ff4ddd8d8170c378349fdd
msgid "**FMOD > Set as Default**：将当前布局设为项目默认值"
msgstr "**FMOD > Set as Default**: Set the current layout as the project default"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:45 97082726d29e4dc79f5104c9ca3b5dc0
msgid "**FMOD > Create FMOD Layout from Godot**：转换 Godot 总线，保存为独立资源，并列出跳过的效果器"
msgstr ""
"**FMOD > Create FMOD Layout from Godot**: Convert Godot buses, save an independent resource, and "
"report skipped effects"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:47 8b9c5d5da0ed483bab1080ab70a82817
msgid "编辑器配置修改会在 0.8 秒后合并保存。保存失败时保留未保存状态。默认布局引用在保存后改用 UID，导出插件会包含默认布局及其依赖资源。"
msgstr ""
"Editor configuration edits are saved after a 0.8-second debounce. A failed save keeps the unsaved"
" state. Saving the default layout replaces its project reference with a UID. The export plugin "
"includes the default layout and its dependencies."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:49 4b21a441426a40e8b2dd28435c3e847c
msgid ""
"独立模式下，电平表显示检查器试听和编辑器内播放的 FMOD 音频，使用编辑器 Audio Buses 的渐变颜色和 tint 设置。峰值保持 1.5 秒，然后以每秒 60 像素回落；电平条以每秒"
" 60 dB 回落。界面最多以 30 Hz 刷新，隐藏时停止轮询。独立游戏进程的电平暂未接入面板。"
msgstr ""
"In independent mode, meters display FMOD inspector audition and editor playback, using the Audio "
"Buses gradient and tint settings. Peaks hold for 1.5 seconds, then fall at 60 pixels per second; "
"level bars fall at 60 dB per second. Presentation refreshes at up to 30 Hz and stops polling when"
" hidden. Meters from a separate game process are not yet connected."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:52 81c04b9f48094753ac69751e08133658
msgid "稳定 ID 与路由"
msgstr "Stable IDs and routing"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:54 8a8b114c0105400d98876c649350ca98
msgid "``Master`` 的 ID 固定为 ``0``，始终位于首项。其他总线名称唯一，不能留空或包含逗号。总线 ID 和效果器槽位 ID 都不等于显示索引。"
msgstr ""
"``Master`` always has ID ``0`` and stays first. Other bus names must be unique, nonblank, and "
"contain no commas. Bus IDs and effect-slot IDs are distinct from display indices."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:56 daa0586037a54e3b9d1a54c18cb05835
msgid ""
"func configure_buses() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var sfx_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if sfx_id == -1:\n"
"        sfx_id = layout.add_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if layout.find_bus_id(&\"Footsteps\") == -1:\n"
"        layout.add_bus(&\"Footsteps\", sfx_id)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_volume_db(sfx_id, -6.0)"
msgstr ""
"func configure_buses() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var sfx_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if sfx_id == -1:\n"
"        sfx_id = layout.add_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    if layout.find_bus_id(&\"Footsteps\") == -1:\n"
"        layout.add_bus(&\"Footsteps\", sfx_id)\n"
"    layout.set_bus_volume_db(sfx_id, -6.0)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:67 ef7c5549ab354ac99acc0ce4d6ae5b7e
msgid ""
"发送目标可以位于列表中的任意位置。``set_bus_send()`` 拒绝发送给自身和产生环路的连接；``move_bus()`` "
"只调整显示顺序。删除总线时，发送到它的其他总线和正在播放的通道会转接到它原来的发送目标。"
msgstr ""
"Sends can target any position in the list. ``set_bus_send()`` rejects self-sends and cycles; "
"``move_bus()`` changes display order only. Removing a bus redirects its incoming buses and "
"playing channels to its previous send target."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:69 2219594225cb474684d516350fe5d9fd
msgid ""
"播放器的 ``bus`` 属性保存名称，检查器选项来自当前 FMOD 布局。未知名称在下次播放时回退到 ``Master``。重命名总线后，应同步修改播放器保存的名称；总线内部 ID "
"和已绑定的运行实例保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Players store bus names in ``bus``; inspector options come from the current FMOD layout. Unknown "
"names fall back to ``Master`` on the next playback. After renaming a bus, update the names stored"
" in players. Internal IDs and bound runtime instances remain stable."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:71 8af62836cc414b1c88706e11602f4ed2
msgid ""
"@onready var music: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $MusicPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    music.bus = &\"Music\"\n"
"    music.play()"
msgstr ""
"@onready var music: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $MusicPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    music.bus = &\"Music\"\n"
"    music.play()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:81 cc87ff8b4c104c779084ec603e2f758d
msgid "音量、静音与独奏"
msgstr "Volume, mute, and solo"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:83 4ab55dc8ff5b45869183779977cd5303
msgid "``0.0`` dB 为单位增益，负值衰减，正值放大。通过布局修改这些参数会更新绑定的运行实例。"
msgstr ""
"``0.0`` dB is unity gain, negative values attenuate, and positive values amplify. Editing these "
"values in the layout updates bound runtime instances."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:85 af0fbe08e4654da194a8a5b10df0e9c9
msgid ""
"func mute_music(muted: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    if music_id != -1:\n"
"        layout.set_bus_mute(music_id, muted)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func solo_voice(enabled: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var voice_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Voice\")\n"
"    if voice_id != -1:\n"
"        layout.set_bus_solo(voice_id, enabled)"
msgstr ""
"func mute_music(muted: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var music_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Music\")\n"
"    if music_id != -1:\n"
"        layout.set_bus_mute(music_id, muted)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func solo_voice(enabled: bool) -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var voice_id: int = layout.find_bus_id(&\"Voice\")\n"
"    if voice_id != -1:\n"
"        layout.set_bus_solo(voice_id, enabled)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:100 9fe14f1652de4635963fb6a8e1e9a2a6
msgid "有总线处于 Solo 状态时，该总线及其通向 ``Master`` 的路径保持可听，其他总线静音。布局保留各总线原有的 Mute 标记，退出 Solo 后恢复应用。"
msgstr ""
"When any bus is soloed, that bus and its route to ``Master`` remain audible while unrelated buses"
" are muted. Configured Mute flags are retained and applied again after Solo is disabled."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:103 27652095b08a4ae58b339c5bb2a39bf6
msgid "效果器配置与运行实例"
msgstr "Effect configuration and runtime instances"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:105 a01b53e8e86b40a9a292a5e5e0ea1032
msgid ""
"``add_bus_effect()`` 接收总线 ID，并返回稳定槽位 ID。同一个效果配置可以用于多个槽位，每个槽位拥有独立 DSP、Capture "
"缓冲、频谱和录音状态。修改配置参数会更新对应实例；调整顺序和移动槽位保留 DSP 状态及延迟、混响尾音。"
msgstr ""
"``add_bus_effect()`` accepts a bus ID and returns a stable slot ID. Several slots can share an "
"effect configuration; each owns independent DSPs, Capture buffers, spectrum data, and recording "
"state. Editing configuration parameters updates the instances. Reordering or moving slots "
"preserves DSP state and delay/reverb tails."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:107 535f42f1624146b9bda50b24645af8c7
msgid ""
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    capture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if capture != null and capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"        var frames: PackedVector2Array = capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"        print(frames[0])"
msgstr ""
"var capture: FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = FmodServer.get_audio_bus_layout()\n"
"    var slot_id: int = layout.add_bus_effect(0, FmodAudioEffectCapture.new())\n"
"    FmodServer.flush_bus_updates()\n"
"    capture = FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance(0, slot_id) as FmodAudioEffectCapture\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n"
"    if capture != null and capture.can_get_buffer(256):\n"
"        var frames: PackedVector2Array = capture.get_buffer(256)\n"
"        print(frames[0])"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:124 c6b255146bdc4403b54a368b2a4c49bb
msgid ""
"使用 :ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"读取实时数据。``get_bus_effect()`` 返回布局中的配置资源。新增槽位后调用 ``flush_bus_updates()``，即可在同一帧读取运行实例。"
msgstr ""
"Use :ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"to read live data. ``get_bus_effect()`` returns the layout configuration resource. After adding a"
" slot, call ``flush_bus_updates()`` to obtain its runtime instance in the same frame."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:126 3db5c76cd40d4be4b53b154d543c71fc
msgid ""
"``set_bus_effect_enabled()`` 控制单个槽位，``set_bus_bypass()`` "
"控制整条总线的受管效果。总线旁路和槽位禁用任一成立时，实例进入旁路。关闭临时效果时可保留槽位，避免重新分配 DSP。"
msgstr ""
"``set_bus_effect_enabled()`` controls one slot, and ``set_bus_bypass()`` controls all managed "
"effects on a bus. Either bus bypass or a disabled slot bypasses the instance. Keep slots when "
"disabling effects temporarily to avoid allocating DSPs again."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:129 9a0483f49baa42d089ef6fe990e3f26b
msgid "切换与保存布局"
msgstr "Switch and save layouts"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:131 93d27afb6d0c4f6ea5cb00531f2f7d8b
msgid ""
"func activate_layout(path: String) -> Error:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = load(path) as FmodAudioBusLayout\n"
"    if layout == null:\n"
"        return ERR_INVALID_DATA\n"
"    return FmodServer.set_audio_bus_layout(layout)"
msgstr ""
"func activate_layout(path: String) -> Error:\n"
"    var layout: FmodAudioBusLayout = load(path) as FmodAudioBusLayout\n"
"    if layout == null:\n"
"        return ERR_INVALID_DATA\n"
"    return FmodServer.set_audio_bus_layout(layout)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:139 57eae133aa2a476080b6f0e0b4cd3ddb
msgid ""
"``set_audio_bus_layout()`` 先验证配置、创建新实例，再替换当前布局。失败时保留当前布局；成功时将播放通道转移到同名总线，找不到时转到 ``Master``。同步模式返回"
" ``ERR_BUSY``。"
msgstr ""
"``set_audio_bus_layout()`` validates the configuration and creates new instances before replacing"
" the current layout. Failure preserves the current layout. Success moves playing channels to "
"matching bus names, falling back to ``Master``. Synchronization mode returns ``ERR_BUSY``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:141 d3debca3c28e471db63a4773ba23d7d4
msgid ""
"切换布局与保存文件分别执行。保存时使用 ``ResourceSaver.save(layout, path)``；将布局设为项目默认值可通过 FMOD Audio "
"面板完成。资源仅保存配置，运行时总线、DSP 和实时音频数据由服务器管理。"
msgstr ""
"Switching layouts and saving files are separate operations. Save with "
"``ResourceSaver.save(layout, path)`` and use FMOD Audio to set a layout as the project default. "
"Resources store configuration; the server owns runtime buses, DSPs, and live audio data."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:144 c9921ebd35834b769a0a7d2c3287ad33
msgid "直接控制运行时对象"
msgstr "Control runtime objects directly"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:146 d237519290f94ccda281d885f8a165f5
msgid ""
"``FmodServer.get_audio_bus(name)`` 和 ``get_audio_bus_by_id(id)`` 返回 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>`。可用 ``get_bus()`` 取得底层 "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`，用于低层播放和混音控制。"
msgstr ""
"``FmodServer.get_audio_bus(name)`` and ``get_audio_bus_by_id(id)`` return "
":ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>`. Call ``get_bus()`` to access the underlying "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` for low-level playback and mixing."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:148 aed793de3a2a4685aac299707323a733
msgid ""
"func play_on_bus(sound: FmodSound, bus_name: StringName) -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(bus_name)\n"
"    var group: FmodChannelGroup = bus.get_bus() if bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    return FmodServer.get_main_system().play_sound(sound, group, false)"
msgstr ""
"func play_on_bus(sound: FmodSound, bus_name: StringName) -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(bus_name)\n"
"    var group: FmodChannelGroup = bus.get_bus() if bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    return FmodServer.get_main_system().play_sound(sound, group, false)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixer.rst:155 77aa6dfb60d4480f936ed91aefaa00cd
